{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "72e19fabae4b8534f35a5f3135c5ac8332a4046905556025ea59608a08f28a97", "ja": "（美希が出演した映画が、ついに公開された。\nファンの間では、ある話題が盛り上がっているようだ）", "zh": "（美希参演的电影终于上映了。粉丝们似乎正在热烈讨论一个话题。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "ebbe0286e6ec65cbcae4badd0bce7f48773a17a2a5e669c7612dd8c73184f0c1", "ja": "『魔王のミキとお姫様のミキ、あなたはどっち推し？』\n……ふぅん。こんな話題、知らなかったの。", "zh": "『魔王美希和公主美希，你更喜欢哪一个？』\n……哦？我还不知道有这种话题呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4dd96341a2c836d863b2c6a2bbd22189ffc4dfa0af6ad641c9f830c64344793c", "ja": "魔王とお姫様、両方の役を演じただろう？\nどちらも、ファンの人に好評みたいだよ。", "zh": "你不是既演过魔王，也演过公主吗？听说这两个角色都很受粉丝欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "0035e38dab603f79d73465b06e518d0d5aa448544e09e03e39d3d48a194a291f", "ja": "そうなんだー。おんなじキャラクターだけど、\n性格っていうか……シュゾクは違うもんね。", "zh": "这样啊——虽然是同一个角色，但性格什么的……种族还是不一样嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "5b1c6de77be24cc62156e25b21f496f28bbd960e912e349169c3edc5b1acbc34", "ja": "{$P$}は、どっちに投票したの？", "zh": "{$P$}投给哪边了呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8b876480f39b174e7a2f1de5981fa2fdfb4c8475dea23b18f43c784f93951aa7", "ja": "いや、投票してないよ。\n話題になってるのも、さっき知ったばかりでね。", "zh": "不，我还没投呢。\n我也是刚才才知道这件事引起了话题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "fa65be2c1f99f230fd1ab867a42a9ad1d0d580533798f539e65f61c28a91ab89", "ja": "じゃあ、今、決めるの！　どっちのミキが好きかで、\nミキのユーワクが変わるんだよ。あはっ☆", "zh": "那就现在决定吧！看你喜欢哪一个美希，美希的诱惑也会改变哦。啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_1007_p", "source_sha256": "690873946bbb607fe190a62d90c7dd267f1a9b3ddf0370a362cf03e55118fb9c", "ja": "え？　誘惑？", "zh": "诶？诱惑？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "53a48e01412965a9b9234a3f8be1ebde970653f3f27e5443605e665894553001", "ja": "うん。マオーのミキが好きならクールでセクシーに！\nお姫様推しなら、今よりかわいいってカンジ。", "zh": "嗯！如果喜欢魔王美希，那就走冷酷性感路线！\n如果更喜欢公主，那就要比现在更可爱一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "1c8bf8ac5d6805a104e6932b4c56038bd79c63d1daeb03e4358c4bbeeff234e0", "ja": "{$P$}の好みって\nちゃんと聞いたことないし……ちょうどいいの！", "zh": "美希从来没有好好打听过\n{$P$}的喜好嘛……正合适呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1c410e62b72fef8f00472a5824a04d4148873bf0c6e27abadf6b3d27a1b7efa6", "ja": "そんなふうに聞かれると答えにくいな……。\nむむむっ……。", "zh": "你这样问的话，还真不好回答啊……  \n唔唔唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_1011", "source_sha256": "527e06bc376f00ab549e247cb285933278169c10d9735c21014ada529e35434e", "ja": "両方！", "zh": "两个都要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_2000_p", "source_sha256": "f169e4f6f9c9270f2a40abcfb297de9d413923fde0f3eebacbe8bc4131d2eaba", "ja": "こうなったら……両方だ！\n決めきれないくらい、どっちも魅力的だからな！", "zh": "既然这样……两个都要！\n因为两边都很有魅力，实在让人难以取舍啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_2001_003mik", "source_sha256": "6042bf357a74af533574727369ca682e77139d24e2800c3986759475b9c524de", "ja": "え～、そこは決めて欲しかったの！\n……でも褒めてくれたし、まぁいっか。", "zh": "诶～，我本来想让你选一个的！\n……不过你夸我了，那就算啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_2002_003mik", "source_sha256": "f02c5ab42b60c8e9eed276ca923e263f6844cbe21c5b6e5d1f24c97f05784654", "ja": "それに、両方好きってことは……\nどっちでユーワクしても効果的ってことだもんね♪", "zh": "而且，既然两个都喜欢，也就是说……不管用哪一个来诱惑，都会很有效呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_2003_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_2004_003mik", "source_sha256": "2b6c992090b9ab071e256e8d300267fd971f18b3eba017503c5d0ab6dce27cd5", "ja": "ミキ的にも、両方気に入ってたから、ちょうどいいの！\nそれじゃハニー、覚悟はいい？", "zh": "美希也正好喜欢这两种，所以刚刚好！\n那么，亲爱的，做好觉悟了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0593_2005_003mik", "source_sha256": "be8fc515a5d91fcb6509216bb9936b1094278c6f37a07a30bdbff4050cd5168a", "ja": "カッコいいミキと、かわいいミキで……\nいーっぱいドキドキさせてあげるからね♪", "zh": "用帅气的美希和可爱的美希……\n让你心动个不停哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
